What is sum if a contains [2, 3, 5]?
int sum = 0;
for (int i = 0; i < a.size(); i++) sum += a.get(i);

What is a.size() afterward if a contains [2, 2, 3]?
for (int i = a.size() - 1; i >= 0; i--)
  if (a.get(i) == 2) a.remove(i);

